{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/model-config.ts",
    "title": "评审模型配置的显式加载边界",
    "summary": "集中确定 repo-review 的模型配置来源、无模型默认值和错误报告策略，并把经过基础结构筛选的配置交给通用模型端口构造器。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "source",
        "title": "配置来源与默认行为",
        "body": "评审模型只从显式环境变量路径或仓库内 `config/review-code-model.json` 读取；环境变量优先，仓库配置不存在时返回无配置。缺少配置被视为正常的“无模型”状态，因此启动本身不会被迫依赖生成式模型，也不会回退读取个人 profile 或秘密。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "validation",
        "title": "解析、校验与端口构造",
        "body": "加载器区分“没有配置”和“明确配置损坏”：前者返回 `transport: none`，后者在不可读、JSON 非法或 transport 不受支持时抛出 `CodeModelUnavailableError`，避免拼写错误被静默吞掉。允许的传输仅为 none、ACP、CLI、HTTP，其余预算、命令、模型、effort、超时和端点字段被转交给通用构造器。[[c2]]\n\n本文件只做来源选择和传输类型的浅层检查；模型与 effort 是否受实际后端支持，以及命令参数是否可执行，应由 `buildUnderstandingModelPort` 及其下游能力发现负责，当前材料没有展示该实现。[[c3]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "评审模型配置路径",
        "reason": "支持环境变量覆盖、仓库配置回退以及缺失配置代表无模型的说明。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/model-config.ts",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 20
        },
        "quote": "/** Review uses the checked-in config/review-code-model.json as its actual\n * profile. REVIEW_CODE_MODEL_CONFIG explicitly overrides it; personal profiles\n * and secrets are never consulted. A missing project profile means no model.\n * Configuring a profile enables explicit generation, never inference on boot. */\nimpor"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "配置解析与传输白名单",
        "reason": "支持损坏配置显式报错、允许的 transport 以及传递配置字段的说明。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/model-config.ts",
          "startLine": 22,
          "endLine": 62
        },
        "quote": "/** Load the explicit review model config. Defaults to no model; never throws on\n * missing config — only throws on an explicitly-broken file so the operator\n * notices a typo instead of silently running without a model. */\nexport function loadReviewCodeModelConfig(\n  path = reviewModelConfigPath(),\n): UnderstandingTra"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "通用模型端口构造",
        "reason": "表明本模块最终依赖通用 understanding model 端口构造器，能力校验细节不在本材料内。",
        "relation": "depends_on",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/model-config.ts",
          "startLine": 65,
          "endLine": 70
        },
        "quote": "/** Build the port from the explicit config file (null = no model). */\nexport function buildReviewCodeModel(\n  path = reviewModelConfigPath(),\n): UnderstandingModelPort | null {\n  const config = loadReviewCodeModelConfig(path);\n  return buildUnderstandingModelPort(config);"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "`buildUnderstandingModelPort` 是否会逐项拒绝后端不支持的 model、effort 和预算组合？",
        "why": "当前文件仅验证 transport 枚举并透传其余字段，无法据此确认运行时能力发现和拒绝策略。",
        "nextStep": "检查通用模型端口实现及其真实 ACP/CLI 测试，确认错误发生在生成前且信息可操作。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c2",
          "c3"
        ]
      }
    ]
